cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this project, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Econometric Modelling of the Italian Energy Market"
abstract: >
  Analysis of dynamic relationships between the Italian National Electricity Price (PUN),
  natural gas prices, and renewable energy production over 2021-2025. Employs time-series
  models including SARIMA, transfer function, VECM, and VAR. Developed for the Statistical
  Models for Economic Data course at the University of Padova (January 2026).
